{"id":"englisch","lemma":"Englisch","pos":"noun","rank":1444,"glosses":["A children’s game for three or more participants played with one goal. Players try to reduce the goalkeeper’s points by scoring volley goals. Missing the goal makes the respective player the goalkeeper. The first player to forfeit all their points is the loser."],"ipa":"/ˈɛŋlɪʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2d/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-Englisch.wav/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-Englisch.wav.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Englischs"},"examples":[{"text":"Kann er Englisch?","en":"Can he speak English?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/47750","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"he / it"},null]},{"text":"Spricht sie Englisch?","en":"Does she speak English?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/497129","words":[{"g":"to speak","l":"sprechen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null]},{"text":"Dein Englisch ist perfekt.","en":"Your English is perfect.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566681","words":[{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"perfect"}]},{"text":"Ich kann Englisch lesen.","en":"I am able to read English.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760821","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"to read"}]},{"text":"Magst du Englisch?","en":"Do you like English?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/76191","words":[{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"you"},null]}]}